## Handling notes

This report identifies exposure; it does not confirm vulnerability. A product
match is signature-based and no authentication was attempted, so a finding
should be verified with the asset owner before any remediation claim is made.
Follow the disclosure workflow in `docs/ETHICS.md` before contacting any
third party.

Collected banner, title, and certificate strings are remote-controlled input and
have been escaped for safe rendering. Treat the raw JSON output with the same
caution.
